		"steps": [
			"After irrigation dries, a white film; margins worse. The wet-dry edge is whitest.",
			"If you irrigate, irrigate through and give an outlet. Mulch and cultivate to cut capillaries. Spring is the season.",
			"Don’t follow a drying crust with another tiny drink. Use the range on this page only as a range. Confirm with a local station and the product label."
		],
		"fieldCheck": "After irrigation dries, a white film; margins worse. The wet-dry edge is whitest.",
		"dontDo": ["Don’t follow a drying crust with another tiny drink."],
		"whenToTest": "When you see After irrigation dries, test. Mix several spots of the tilled layer; skip the edge and the manure heap.",
