		"conditions": "Gypsum’s calcium swaps sodium, then water must wash sodium away. No drainage, wasted gypsum. Salt soils want leaching.",
		"plainExplain": "Gypsum’s calcium swaps sodium, then water must wash sodium away. No drainage, wasted gypsum. Salt soils want leaching.",
		"natural": ["Gypsum’s calcium swaps sodium, then water must wash sodium away..", "No drainage, wasted gypsum.."],
