		"longform": ["A shiny hard layer below 15–20 cm; roots turn. The top ponds after rain. The same rotary depth every year, plus wet traffic, irons a pan. Shallow roots then fear both drought and flood. Don’t fluff 15 cm and pack it again. On this patch, a shiny hard layer below 15–20 cm; roots turn. The top ponds after rain is the first clue."],
