		"longform": ["Salt patches plus sick plants in the house; more death each year. Not one missing nutrient. Salt, disease and burn stew in one pot. One bottle and one bag will not un-stew it. Test EC, then the root. Don’t only feed. On this patch, salt patches plus sick plants in the house; more death each year. Not one missing nutrient is the first clue."],
