		"fieldCheck": "Tea shoots short, leaves small; someone copied grain lime and it yellowed more. Tea’s window is about 4.5–6.0.",
		"dontDo": ["Don’t start at 150 kg/mu like grain; don’t push tea to pH 7; don’t throw lime on the collar."],
		"whenToTest": "When you see Tea shoots short, test. Mix several spots of the tilled layer; skip the edge and the manure heap.",
