		"plainExplain": "Salt land is shallow water: learn to swim before you race. Tolerant crops beat a high-yield compound recipe.",
		"natural": ["Salt land is shallow water: learn to swim before you race..", "Tolerant crops beat a high-yield compound recipe.."],
