		"longform": ["Year after year, missing plants; maize is a gamble. A salt-tolerant neighbour still stands. Salt land is shallow water: learn to swim before you race. Tolerant crops beat a high-yield compound recipe. Don’t paste a neighbour’s density. On this patch, year after year is the first clue."],
		"summary": "Match salt tolerance, plant on ridges, don’t start with the thirstiest crop.",
